# 4. Store adapters separately

A typical object storage structure:

```text
s3://company-models/

    base-models/
        llama-8b/

    adapters/
        tenant-a/
            finance-v1/
                adapter_model.safetensors
                adapter_config.json

        tenant-b/
            support-v3/
                adapter_model.safetensors
                adapter_config.json
```

Important rule:

```text
Adapter
   ↓
Must be compatible with
   ↓
Base Model
```

For every adapter, store metadata such as:

```json
{
    "adapter_name": "finance-v1",
    "version": "1.0",
    "base_model": "llama-base-v1",
    "lora_rank": 16,
    "dataset_version": "finance-data-v4",
    "git_commit": "abc123"
}
```

