# 11. LRU adapter cache

A simple implementation:

```python
from collections import OrderedDict


class LRUAdapterCache:

    def __init__(
        self,
        capacity: int
    ):

        self.capacity = capacity

        self.cache = OrderedDict()


    def get(
        self,
        adapter_id: str
    ):

        if adapter_id not in self.cache:

            return None

        self.cache.move_to_end(
            adapter_id
        )

        return self.cache[
            adapter_id
        ]


    def put(
        self,
        adapter_id: str,
        adapter
    ):

        if adapter_id in self.cache:

            self.cache.move_to_end(
                adapter_id
            )

        self.cache[
            adapter_id
        ] = adapter

        if len(self.cache) > self.capacity:

            evicted_id, _ = (
                self.cache.popitem(
                    last=False
                )
            )

            return evicted_id
```

Production strategy:

```text
Most frequently used adapters
        ↓
GPU

Moderately used adapters
        ↓
CPU cache

Rare adapters
        ↓
Object storage
```

