# 18. Important production problem: noisy neighbors

Suppose:

```text
Tenant A → 10 requests/minute
Tenant B → 10,000 requests/minute
```

Tenant B could consume all GPU capacity.

Use:

```text
Rate limiting
Per-tenant quotas
Concurrency limits
Priority queues
Separate GPU pools for premium customers
```

Example:

```text
Tenant A
Concurrency = 5

Tenant B
Concurrency = 20

Tenant C
Concurrency = 2
```

This is particularly important in a multi-tenant AI platform.

---

# 19. What if one adapter is very popular?

Example:

```text
Adapter A → 80% traffic
Adapter B → 10%
Adapter C → 5%
Other adapters → 5%
```

Optimize:

```text
GPU 1
  Adapter A permanently warm

GPU 2
  Adapter A permanently warm

GPU 3
  Dynamic adapters

GPU 4
  Dynamic adapters
```

This avoids repeatedly loading the most popular adapter.

